@startuml Hinh_2_1_Sequence_Dang_ky_KYC
title Hình 2.1 / 2.11 – Sequence: Đăng ký và Luồng duyệt KYC
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Web/Mobile\n(React/Expo)" as UI
participant "AuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "AuthService" as AuthSvc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "AdminController" as AdminCtrl
participant "AdminService" as AdminSvc

== Đăng ký tài khoản ==
User -> UI : Nhập email, phone, password, fullName
UI -> AuthCtrl : POST /api/v1/auth/register
AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc : register(request)
AuthSvc -> DB : Kiểm tra email/phone trùng
AuthSvc -> DB : Lưu User\n(role=USER, kycStatus=PENDING, status=ACTIVE)
AuthSvc -> DB : Tạo Account VND mặc định (AccountService)
AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl : User + tokens (optional)
AuthCtrl --> UI : 201 Created
UI --> User : Đăng ký thành công\n(KYC = PENDING)

== Admin duyệt KYC ==
Admin -> UI : Mở Admin Dashboard
UI -> AdminCtrl : GET /api/v1/admin/users
AdminCtrl -> AdminSvc : listUsers()
AdminSvc -> DB : Truy vấn users
AdminSvc --> AdminCtrl : Danh sách user
AdminCtrl --> UI : Hiển thị user chờ KYC

Admin -> UI : Duyệt KYC (VERIFIED/REJECTED)
UI -> AdminCtrl : PUT /api/v1/admin/users/{id}/kyc\n{kycStatus, note}
AdminCtrl -> AdminSvc : updateKyc(id, request)
AdminSvc -> DB : Cập nhật User.kycStatus
AdminSvc -> DB : Ghi AuditLog (KYC_UPDATE)
AdminSvc --> AdminCtrl : AdminUserResponse
AdminCtrl --> UI : 200 OK
UI --> Admin : Thông báo duyệt KYC thành công

note over User, DB
  User chưa VERIFIED: giao dịch > 10 triệu VND bị từ chối
  (validateUserForTransaction trong TransactionService)
end note

@enduml
